  <p class="note-line">Return tomorrow before rereading the lesson. Complete the <a href="#next-day-retrieval">five-minute next-day retrieval</a>, then revisit only the category, information chain, or place contrast that still feels slow.</p>

  <section id="next-day-retrieval" data-lesson-extension="Five-minute next-day room category, information, and location retrieval">
    <h2>Next-day retrieval</h2>
    <div class="lead-rule"></div>
    <div class="practice" data-choice-gap-drill data-success-message="Correct. You retrieved uncountable furniture, known-object reference, and the no-contact meaning of above.">
      <h3>Choose the missing room-description language</h3>
      <div class="choice-bank" aria-label="Next-day room description choices">
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="some">some</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="a">a</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="It is">It is</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="There is">There is</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="above">above</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="on">on</button>
      </div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>The studio contains an unspecified amount of furniture: There is <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="some" data-hint="Furniture is uncountable, so use some rather than a." data-fix="There is some furniture in the studio." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> furniture in the studio.</span></div>
